WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:13.668
Marketing and Social puts your posts for Facebook, Instagram, Google, and LinkedIn on one calendar, with AI writing each version in your voice. In this video, you’ll set it up, publish a post, and answer a review.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:25.988
First, a System Admin connects each account in Apps, under Marketing and website. For Facebook and Instagram, you choose the Pages to use, and which café each one belongs to.

00:00:26.767 --> 00:00:36.601
In Marketing, Brand and settings is what AI reads every time it writes for you: what you sell, who your customers are, your tone, and the words to use and avoid.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:43.232
Want a second pair of eyes? Turn on approvals, and choose who approves. Nothing goes out that wasn’t approved.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.149
Social shows every post on its day: scheduled, posted, waiting for approval, or failed, with what needs attention alongside.

00:00:52.600 --> 00:01:00.621
Click New post, and pick the channels. Then say what it’s about, and Write with AI drafts a version for each channel, in your brand voice.

00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:10.084
Each version stays within that platform’s limits, with a live count, and the preview shows where it will go. AI never makes up prices or offers.

00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:13.093
Pick when it should go out, and send it for approval.

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:25.307
The approver sees it in the post, or under Approvals, and clicks Approve, or asks for changes. Approved posts go out on their own at the time you chose.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:32.713
Results shows how every post did: views, reactions, comments, and shares, for each channel and each post.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:40.881
The Inbox brings in comments on your posts, and your Google reviews. Lee left an unhappy review this morning about a slow line.

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:50.187
Write with AI suggests replies in your voice. Pick one, check it, and post it in public as your business. If it needs fixing, make it a ticket.

00:01:50.967 --> 00:01:57.772
And SEO and website shows what people search for to find you, with ideas for posts that answer those searches.
